  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  stageNumber: 6
  stageTitle: "STAGE 6 \u2014 THE SHIP GRAVEYARD"
  objective: 2
  objectiveText: Cross the graveyard
  introText: 'The repair held just long enough to throw the ship into a graveyard
    of dead ships. You pull the engine halves back out to keep them safe.


    The
    only way through is along the old salvage cranes. B can freeze a swinging seat
    in place. A can flip gravity where the ground runs out.'
  completeTitle: THROUGH THE GRAVEYARD
  completeText: The far dock is clear and the engine is still in one piece. But whatever
    passed overhead has found you.
  isFinalStage: 0
  holdToResetSeconds: 1
  playAmbience: 1
  autoContinueAfter: 4
  autoStartAfter: 8
